<title>UK: RUSSIA SETS 1.0 BLN FIVE-YEAR EUROBOND - FULL TABLE.</title>
<headline>RUSSIA SETS 1.0 BLN FIVE-YEAR EUROBOND - FULL TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers J.P. Morgan and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RUSSIA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN	COUPON     ***	 MATURITY    27.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  ***	 PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    ***	 SPREAD	+345 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) =	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/RU/FR</p>
<p> IBCA	 BB+</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA</p>
<p> NOTES	*** TO BE PRICED</p>
</text>
